        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smith Auctioneers are delighted to offer to the market this charming 4 bed bungalow, centrally located in the village of Keshcarrigan and only a short drive to Carrick on Shannon town centre and all its amenities.\r\n\r\n The property is finished to the highest standards throughout, sitting on circa 0.5-acre site with gardens to the front & side with an integrated garage at the rear. \r\n\r\nAccommodation includes, Entrance Hall, Kitchen, Utility Room, Wc, Sitting Room, 4 Bedrooms (1 En Suite), main bathroom and hot press.\r\n\r\nProperties like this rarely come on the market in this area and viewing is highly recommended."
      },
